window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I thought I’d lost my fated mate until he shows up years later. Only with no memory of me. Or us.</p> <p>As Beta of the Aspen Pack, I was forced to watch our former Alpha turn to dark magic and destroy the bonds of our people.</p> <p>I nearly died trying to save us, but I broke the biggest taboo: I told the others that cat-shifters existed and almost lost everything in return.</p> <p>We have a new Alpha, a new future, and a dangerous and mysterious enemy threatening our stable balance. And a new Tracker.</p> <p>The man who looks like my dead mate.</p>"; 
